	"data": "Delsys Cover Letter\n\nMansfield, MA\n3/06/2026\nDear Hiring Manager,\nI am writing to express my interest in the Software Engineer – Backend Intern position at Delsys Inc. As a computer science student graduating in May 2026 with experience in backend development, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your pioneering work in wearable sensor technology and biosignal processing systems.\nMy professional experience at Infosys provided me with a solid foundation in backend development…",
